    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiro ekyo Omukama Ahasuero aha Esita mukaziwe enju ya Hamani, omubisha w'Abayahudi. Aho Moridekai aija omu mabona g'Omukama, kuba Esita akaba yamumanyisize okwo balikukwatana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama ajura empetaye y'omuhuri, eyo yabaire ayakire Hamani, agiha Moridekai. Kandi Esita akwasa Moridekai enju ya Hamani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Esita ashuba agambira Omukama; amugwa omu maguru nalira, amutagiliza kutahondera kigambo kya Hamani Omuagagi, kwita Abayahudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama aimukiza Esita enkoni y'ezahabu ey'obukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esita aimuka ayemelera omu mabona ge. Agamba ati, “Omukama asinge angiliire ekisha, kandi kagarazoka gali mazima omu maisho g'Omukama, nanye ansingire, omuku guhandikwe kufuta ebarua ezo Hamani Omuagagi eya Hamedata abaire ahandikire naragira kusilikya Abayahudi omu mikoa yona y'Omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuba nakwemera ntai kubona akabuta akalikwizira eihanga lyange? Handiki nakwemera ntai kubona abanyaruganda bange nibahwaho?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikwo Omukama Ahasuero kugambira Esita na Moridekai ati, “Leba, enju ya Hamani nagihaire Esita, na wenene Hamani bamuhanikire aha kitanzi kuba abaire naija kwita Abayahudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu nainywe muhandikire Abayahudi omw'ibara lyange nk'okwo mulikwenda, mugimaamise empeta yange. Kuba omuku oguhandikirwe omw'ibara ly'Omukama, bakagimaamisa empetaye tigwakuhindurwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kanya ako, aha kiro kya makumi gabili na bishatu ky'omwezi gwa kashatu, ogwetwa Sivani, bahuruza abahandiki b'Omukama. Bahandika omuku nk'okwo Moridekai yaragiire ahali byona ebikwete Abayahudi. Bahandikira abakungu n'abagavana n'abatwazi b'emikoa 127, kwema India kugoba Etiopia. Buli mukoa baguhandikira ebarua eyagwo, na buli ihanga omu rulimi rwalyo. Kwakwo bahandikira n'Abayahudi omu mihandikire eyabo n'omu rulimi orwabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebarua zihandikwa omw'ibara ly'Omukama Ahasuero, bazimaamisa empetaye. Bazitweka abatarishi bakuubire efarasi ezilikwiruka muno ezakoraga emilimo y'Omukama, zizairwe efarasi ez'Omukama wenene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu barua ezi Omukama ajubura Abayahudi ba buli kigo kwema hamoi bakerwanaho batabaita, basilikye, bakindure, bamareho buli ihe lya buli ihanga anga omukoa ogwakubatabalire. Baite abana babo na bakazi babo, babanyage n'ebyabo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ebyo bikorwe ekiro kimoi omu mikoa yona y'Omukama Ahasuero, nikyo kiro kya ikumi na bishatu ky'omwezi gwa ikumi n'ebili, ogwetwa Adari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekopi y'ebarua eyahandikiirwe, eturuka guli muku omuli buli mukoa mara erangwa omu mahanga gona. Abayahudi baragirwa kushangwa betekatekire kwehora ababisha babo aha kir'ekyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo abatarishi bakuba efarasi ezilikwiruka muno ezakozibwaga omu milimo y'obukama. Bairuka bwangu kugobesheleza omuku gw'Omukama; mara baguranga n'omu kigo kya Susa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Moridekai aruga obuso, ayambaire enyambarwa z'obukama eza kibururu n'ezilikwera. Akaba ayambaire orukinga rw'obukama orw'ezahabu, n'ebebo ya kitani nungi na zambarau. Omu kanya ako ekigo kikuru kya Susa batamu orusharo, bashemelerwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abayahudi bakyanuka, bashemelerwa, bagira ebyera, bakunirwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuli buli mukoa na buli kigo mbali omuhango gw'Omukama n'omukugwe byagobire, Abayahudi bashemelerwa, bagira ebyera, bakora amagenyi; kiba kiro ky'ekyosi. Abanyamahanga bangi ab'omu nsi egyo bakeyeta Bayahudi, kuba Abayahudi bakabatinisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
